  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The intersection point of $y=x-2$ and $y=\\sqrt{x}$ is $(4,2)$.\nThe required area\n$$\n=\\int_0^4 \\sqrt{x} d x-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times 2=\\frac{16}{3}-2=\\frac{10}{3}\n$$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/vIwh5NSviP1EpWack9vseRpA7D9EWyWMySayl42G1DY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
